The decoder was written from ISO/IEC 14496-3 (MPEG-4 Audio). Standard tables
(scale factor bands, window shapes, SBR/PS tables) follow the specification.

src/huffman_tables.rs: the spectral and scale factor Huffman code tables were
taken from the VisualOn AAC encoder (aacenc/src/aac_rom.c, part of the Android
